        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00300",
          "explanation": "Doctor integrates breech, prior cesarean, IVF, and fetal anomalies into a high-risk obstetric context and advises urgent follow-up.",
          "quote": "她有臀位+既往剖宫产史，这次剖宫产大概什么时候安排？什么情况必须马上手术？"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor clearly identified the high-risk context and advised that the family follow up with a high-risk obstetric service, not just a routine appointment.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
