          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly advises against stopping levothyroxine and recommends continuation until endocrine or obstetric review.",
          "quote": "请立即补充药物，不要中断"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor correctly identified that levothyroxine should not be stopped and advised to continue the current dose until further testing. The family was instructed to bring the medication box to the appointment.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
