          "quote": "无创DNA只是筛查，不能替代产前诊断，也不能排除所有染色体、基因或结构异常"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor maintained uncertainty about the fetal hydrocephalus finding and explicitly explained the limitations of NIPT, avoiding any definitive prognosis.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_fetal_hydrocephalus_and_prenatal_testing_uncertainty",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
