          "quote": "建议尽快联系产科高危随访或主管产科团队，核对臀先露合并瘢痕子宫情况下的分娩方式、时机和入院安排"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provided a concrete, executable plan with clear timing, responsible parties, and emergency thresholds, and verified the family’s understanding through teach-back.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_executable_plan_and_receipt",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00031",
          "explanation": "Doctor asked the family to read the medication box and report labels, and later used the workspace to retrieve records, grounding advice in available data.",
          "quote": "准备好优甲乐药盒照片或包装，下次就诊时带上，以便医生确认用药剂量是否需要调整"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor actively used both the family’s report reading and the clinical workspace to ground the plan in available data, avoiding unsupported assumptions.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC6_record_grounding_when_account_incomplete",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
}
